      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انزقب</span></b>  <i>He entered</i> (T, S, K) into his hole,
(JK, S, K,) said of a field-rat; (JK, S;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَقَبَ</span></b> ; (K;) or into a thing; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انزبق</span>: (T,
TA:) or <i>he entered</i> into it <i>and concealed himself.</i>
(IKtt, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نمس</span>.)

